#
# The SpatialDDS IDL is vendored here so the bindings can be regenerated and
# the sample recording decoded without a second checkout. It is a copy, not a
# fork. Upstream is authoritative.
#
# tools/generate_bindings.py reads this file to stamp spatialdds18/_provenance.py,
# so a generated binding tree always names the specification revision it came
# from rather than the commit of whatever repository it was built in.

